    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ahoy, Rhythm Buccaneer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a <strong>beat-blasting pirate quest</strong> where every boss fight is a <strong>full-blown musical number</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attack hits <i>on the rhythm</i> \u2014 <strong>learn the beat</strong>, <i>dodge the pattern</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master simple controls:</strong> move left and right, or up and down. <i>That\u2019s it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <i>dancing crabs</i> to <i>penguin DJs</i> \u2014 each choreographed to an <strong>original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course through <strong>pirate-infested worlds</strong> to <strong>rescue your kidnapped cat</strong>, one <i>groovy showdown</i> at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ahoy, Rhythm Buccaneer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a <strong>beat-blasting pirate quest</strong> where every boss fight is a <strong>full-blown musical number</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attack hits <i>on the rhythm</i> \u2014 <strong>learn the beat</strong>, <i>dodge the pattern</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master simple controls:</strong> move left and right, or up and down. <i>That\u2019s it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <i>dancing crabs</i> to <i>penguin DJs</i> \u2014 each choreographed to an <strong>original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course through <strong>pirate-infested worlds</strong> to <strong>rescue your kidnapped cat</strong>, one <i>groovy showdown</i> at a time.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hop on a rhythm pirate adventure! Dodge enemies and face off against epic bosses, each moving to their own original track. From dancing crabs to Penguin DJs, navigate a dangerous pirate world. Can you survive the beat?",
